    <mxCell id="p0" value="One stack per retailer&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-size:11px;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;v2 assumed one retailer. A second customer meant a full copy: app, database, sync, monitoring. Ten customers, ten of everything.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBE3E3;strokeColor=#C94545;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=34;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" vertex="1" parent="1">
